            'builds.classes.heavyguardian.specs.earthfort.description': 'Heavy Guardian Earthfort focuses on resource generation and massive defensive utility. Its gameplay revolves around building and spending its main resources of Sand Crystals and Rage to survive and control the battlefield.',
            'builds.classes.heavyguardian.specs.earthfort.playstyle': 'Its main gameplay loop relies on using skills like Sandshroud and Star Shatter to quickly generate Sand Crystals and Rage. These resources are then spent on abilities like Rage Burst and Shield Bash to apply powerful stackable shields.',
